{
  "title": "Synthesis and X-ray crystal structure of cationic polynuclear hydroxide acetylacetonate lanthanide(III) clusters with homodinuclear or heterodinuclear decacarbonyl hydrides: [HMo2(CO)10]− and [HCrW(CO)10]−",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.jallcom.2004.12.132",
  "list_of_rare_earth_compounds": [
